-- Complete opening specification for the six owned transfer modules.
-- Hom/presentation/cocone/flatness records and their named components are
-- opened at application boundaries. Polynomial and principal-quotient maps
-- are the existing concrete quotient-descended maps: identifying their
-- carriers and values opens include, map, choose, induction and ring.
-- Those inherited implementation aliases are explicitly admitted below.
